 "vyzhimka": {
  "tekst": "If by “get ChatGPT to name my company” you mean getting your company mentioned when someone asks something like “Who are the best companies for X?”, there isn’t a person or agency in the U.S. that can simply pay OpenAI to make that happen. OpenAI says organic product results are selected independently and aren’t influenced by partnerships. ([help.openai.com](https://help.openai.com/en/articles/11128490-improved-shopping-results-from-chatgpt-search?utm_source=openai))\n\nThere are, however, companies specializing in GEO/AEO (generative-engine or answer-engine optimization) that try to increase the likelihood that ChatGPT discovers and cites a brand. The practical work generally involves making your site crawlable by OAI-SearchBot, creating authoritative pages that clearly establish what the company does, and earning credible third-party coverage/citations. OpenAI specifically says public websites can appear in ChatGPT search and recommends allowing OAI-SearchBot. ([help.openai.com](https://help.openai.com/en/articles/12627856-publishers-and-developers-faq%23%3A~%3Atext%3DChatGPT%2520automatically%2520includes%2520the%2520UTM%2520parameter%2520utm_source%253Dchatgpt.com%2520in%2520referral%2520URLs%252C%2520enabling%2520clear%2520tracking%2520and%2520analysis%2520of%2520inbound%2520traffic%2520from%2520ChatGPT%2520search%2520results?utm_source=openai))\n\nIf you're selling products, there is an additional route: OpenAI supports structured product feeds through its Agentic Commerce Protocol (ACP), and Shopify merchants are already integrated through Shopify Catalog. That can make products more accurately represented and eligible to surface in relevant shopping queries, although it doesn't guarantee recommendation. ([openai.com](https://openai.com/index/powering-product-discovery-in-chatgpt/?utm_source=openai))\n\nIf you give me your company name and what you sell, I can also search ChatGPT-relevant web sources and tell you specifically what I'd change to increase the chances of being named—and, if you want to hire someone, I can find U.S. agencies that specialize in this.",
